    solid-memo:back "In the Kuiper Belt, beyond Neptune"@en ,
                    "I Kuiperbältet, bortom Neptunus"@sv .

<#dwarf-planet-eris>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 4 ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-04T12:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Where does the dwarf planet Eris orbit?"@en ,
                     "Var kretsar dvärgplaneten Eris?"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "Beyond Neptune"@en ,
                    "Bortom Neptunus"@sv ;
    solid-memo:backNote "On a long, steeply tilted orbit reaching far beyond the Kuiper Belt; NASA counts it among the Kuiper Belt objects, others place it in the scattered disc."@en ,
                        "I en lång, kraftigt lutande bana som når långt bortom Kuiperbältet; NASA räknar den till Kuiperbältets objekt, andra till den spridda skivan."@sv .

